  "description": "A .NET resilience library built around one flat execution engine, a declarative policy value, and defaults that are correct without configuration. Includes the HTTP integration: a delegating handler that clones the request per attempt, refuses to retry unsafe methods by default, scopes breakers and budgets per host, owns the transport timeout, and reports nested retries. No package dependencies.",
